vdr-skin-anthra-ost packaging
=============================

The repository follows the git-buildpackage layout:

  debian/trixie   upstream source with the Debian packaging
  upstream        the imported upstream tarballs
  pristine-tar    data to recreate the orig tarballs

The skin needs no build options, it is installed as it is to
/var/lib/vdr/plugins/text2skin/anthra_OSt, its themes to /var/lib/vdr/themes.
Relative paths of the skin options (e.g. ../liquid-logos4separator) are
taken from that folder, so it is not a symlink into /usr/share.

Build with git-buildpackage:

  gbp clone <repository> && cd vdr-skin-anthra-ost
  gbp buildpackage
